  "description": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 48 Park Vale, Grange Rath, Drogheda which is a first floor large two bedroom apartment in a much desired estate. This spacious apartment has its own front door and is well positioned at the rear of the estate adjacent to a wooded green area.\n\nThe property is well located within walking distance of excellent amenities including Southgate Shopping Centre, beautiful beeches, creches and schools. Grange Rath is south east of Drogheda between the M1 Motorway and the town centre and benefit's from convenient access to the M1 Motorway and is just a 10 minute drive from Bettystown and Mornington beach. The property is ideally located for commuters, just a short walk from the Matthews Coach stop offering direct access to Dublin, and only a brief drive to Drogheda Train Station and the M1 motorway.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a bright living room to the front with balcony, kitchen, main bathroom, two storage closets, a double bedroom and a master ensuite bedroom.\n\nViewings by Appointment.",
